  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow-up to the Midterm Review of the IPoA for LDCs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at increasing the capacity and enhancing the exchange of experience among LDC stakeholders about the implementation of the IpoA and the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. It will also promote national ownership and localisation of the goals of the IpoA and the SDGs in the national development plans and strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
